  "b_sEd1oqGz9Al": {
    "bId": "b_sEd1oqGz9Al",
    "brandName": "Break The Circle",
    "brandDescription": "There are people walking past you every single day, in coffee shops, in office hallways, in classrooms, who carry stories that could change your life. Stories of building something from nothing. Of being told to sit down, then standing up anyway. Of finding purpose on the other side of a failure nobody knows about.\n\nBut they never got a stage. So nobody knows their name.\n\nBreak The Circle exists to fix that.\nWe find the knowledgeable but overlooked. The brilliant but unheard. The people who earned their wisdom the hard way, through rejection, sacrifice, and reinvention.",
